WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:27.399
One day Rex was in the park.

2
00:00:27.399 --> 00:00:34.689
He saw other dinosaurs.

3
00:00:34.689 --> 00:00:39.140
"Hi!" Rex said.

4
00:00:39.140 --> 00:00:42.058
"Help!" a dinosaur cried.

5
00:00:42.058 --> 00:00:46.144
"A T. rex!" the other one screamed.

6
00:00:46.144 --> 00:00:49.051
They ran away.

7
00:00:49.051 --> 00:00:54.954
Rex saw another dinosaur. "Hello!"

8
00:00:54.955 --> 00:00:58.800
"Don't eat me!" she said.

9
00:00:58.801 --> 00:01:01.330
She ran away too.

10
00:01:01.330 --> 00:01:07.266
Rex sighed.

11
00:01:07.266 --> 00:01:11.724
"Nobody will be my friend."

12
00:01:11.724 --> 00:01:17.681
Rex kicked a rock.

13
00:01:17.681 --> 00:01:20.144
He sat down.

14
00:01:20.144 --> 00:01:23.531
"Help!" cried a dinosaur.

15
00:01:23.532 --> 00:01:26.535
He stood behind a tree.

16
00:01:26.535 --> 00:01:29.641
"Oh no," Rex said.

17
00:01:29.641 --> 00:01:32.570
"He's afraid of me too!"

18
00:01:32.578 --> 00:01:36.369
"Help!" the dinosaur cried again.

19
00:01:36.369 --> 00:01:40.394
Rex got mad.

20
00:01:40.395 --> 00:01:44.498
"I won't eat you!" he said.

21
00:01:44.499 --> 00:01:47.538
The dinosaur blinked.

22
00:01:47.539 --> 00:01:51.279
Then he said, "Help me!"

23
00:01:51.279 --> 00:01:53.747
"Huh?" Rex said.

24
00:01:53.747 --> 00:01:57.617
"I'm stuck!" the dinosaur said.

25
00:01:57.617 --> 00:02:01.921
"See?"

26
00:02:01.922 --> 00:02:03.670
Rex looked.

27
00:02:03.670 --> 00:02:06.540
The dinosaur's tail had spikes.

28
00:02:06.540 --> 00:02:10.812
One spike was stuck in a tree.

29
00:02:10.812 --> 00:02:13.484
The dinosaur grinned.

30
00:02:13.484 --> 00:02:19.320
"Can you please help me?"

